# Removes "ALLOW admin READ reports". Admins lose access they had, so this is
# NOT equivalent to optimizable.pol, but it never allows anything new.
# Passes "non-weakening" mode, fails "equivalent" mode.
# python -m policyc.verification verify examples/optimizable.pol examples/candidate_stricter.pol
# python -m policyc.verification verify examples/optimizable.pol examples/candidate_stricter.pol --mode equivalent

SUBJECT admin, analyst, guest

RESOURCE database SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE reports  SUPPORTS READ, WRITE

ALLOW admin ACCESS database
ALLOW analyst READ reports WHEN authenticated
DENY guest ACCESS database
